{'symbol': 'FTV', 'date': '2023-01-24 16:15:00', 'title': 'FORTIVE DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON ITS COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'EVERETT, WASH.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--FORTIVE CORPORATION (“FORTIVE”) (NYSE: FTV) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.07 PER SHARE OF ITS COMMON STOCK, PAR VALUE $0.01 PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON MARCH 31, 2023 TO COMMON STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD ON FEBRUARY 24, 2023. ALTHOUGH FORTIVE EXPECTS TO PAY DIVIDENDS ON A QUARTERLY BASIS, ANY SUBSEQUENT DECLARATION OF DIVIDENDS, INCLUDING THE AMOUNT, THE RECORD DATES AND THE PAYMENT DATES FOR ANY SUCH FUTURE DIVIDEND PAYMENTS, IS SUBJECT TO THE DISCRETION OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS.'}